{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20418",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 5.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started. Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.08,
      "end_seconds": 15.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.15,
      "end_seconds": 17.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.09,
      "end_seconds": 26.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Mainly yellow eyes. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.13,
      "end_seconds": 30.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.84,
      "end_seconds": 35.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I'm on alendronate, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.64,
      "end_seconds": 39.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.04,
      "end_seconds": 48.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "70 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.36,
      "end_seconds": 62.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Alright, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.93,
      "end_seconds": 66.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "So, it's been one week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.86,
      "end_seconds": 71.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.55,
      "end_seconds": 87.0,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Pale stools goes along with it, most of the time. The pale stools? That's been for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.42,
      "end_seconds": 92.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. A few quick ones: itching, confusion or vomiting blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.67,
      "end_seconds": 96.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Mm, no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.92,
      "end_seconds": 102.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.77,
      "end_seconds": 104.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.68,
      "end_seconds": 111.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.76,
      "end_seconds": 114.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Ah, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.88,
      "end_seconds": 118.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.57,
      "end_seconds": 126.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Hmm, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.42,
      "end_seconds": 132.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.88,
      "end_seconds": 135.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I've got thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.63,
      "end_seconds": 140.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.34,
      "end_seconds": 153.51,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.11,
      "end_seconds": 175.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "So, do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.19,
      "end_seconds": 179.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Yes, naproxen, it gives me stomach pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.71,
      "end_seconds": 183.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.83,
      "end_seconds": 191.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.67,
      "end_seconds": 220.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse 86, blood pressure 125 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.78,
      "end_seconds": 223.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.13,
      "end_seconds": 229.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.21,
      "end_seconds": 247.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.39,
      "text": "Going by what you've described, I don't have a clear answer today: an acute viral hepatitis is possible, and so is gallstones blocking the bile duct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.87,
      "end_seconds": 255.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.37,
      "end_seconds": 265.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an acute viral hepatitis is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.26,
      "end_seconds": 291.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Let's book a hepatitis screen to look into jaundice. No alcohol at all and avoid paracetamol and other painkillers unless we say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.22,
      "end_seconds": 299.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Ah. See me again after the results. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.67,
      "end_seconds": 306.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Ah, um, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.25,
      "end_seconds": 308.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}